        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "### Pitch\n\nBuild AI-powered lead workflows in PHP without stitching together brittle prompt logic and provider-specific APIs. Instructor PHP turns inbound messages and prospect data into validated CRM-ready records; Polyglot lets you switch LLM providers; and Retrieval and Agents help qualify leads, ground responses in your sales playbook, and automate follow-up workflows.\n\n### Lead-gen problems it can solve\n\n- **Messy lead intake:** Extract names, company details, needs, and contact information from forms, emails, and chat into typed, validated records.\n- **Inconsistent qualification:** Classify intent, fit, urgency, and buying signals with structured decisions your routing logic can use.\n- **Slow enrichment at scale:** Run asynchronous batch inference over large prospect lists for classification, summarization, or tailored outreach preparation.\n- **Generic or off-brand responses:** Ground lead replies and sales-assist workflows in product docs, pricing, and approved messaging using retrieval.\n- **Manual sales handoffs:** Use agents and custom tools to automate steps such as lead triage, CRM updates, and escalation—while keeping control of the workflow.\n- **Provider lock-in:** Test and switch among supported LLM providers through a unified PHP API.",
